1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:03,160
(Leonard:)I don't listen for it,
but it's nice to know

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:06,730
(Leonard:)everything's okay
with your plumbing.

3
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:08,600
(Leonard:)The building's plumbing.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,800
(Penny:)Leonard, I get it.

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,260
(Priya:)You're in
a new relationship now.

6
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:12,500
(Penny:)And I'm happy for you.

7
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,970
(Penny:)So why don't we
just shake hands
and part friends?

8
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,170
(Leonard:)Well, now hold on.

9
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,400
(Leonard:)How about this?

10
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:20,610
(Leonard:)How about we still hang out,
but on the down-low?

11
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:24,140
(Penny:)Are you really that kind of guy?

12
00:00:24,150 --> 00:00:25,810
(Priya:)No.

13
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:30,020
(Leonard:)I actually felt kinda silly just
saying "on the down-low."

14
00:00:31,790 --> 00:00:33,570
(Penny:)Good-bye, Leonard.

15
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:38,160
(Leonard:)Penny, wait.

16
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:41,660
(Howard:)Ah!

17
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,430
Damn contacts.

18
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:53,320
(Howard:)Incoming.

19
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,910
(Penny(knocking on window):)- Hi!
- Hey!

20
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:58,160
(Sheldon:)Hello.

